# Derived by hand from ruling HP (`@Host` a widget value like any other) and ruling PL: `@Through` at 0 holds its places in its own list; the host it applies stands at its 0, a widget application of its own (`0/0`), which hosts at its own 0 (`0/0/0.[p]/0`); the label is `@Through`'s 1. A forwarded click reaches the guest in its tick.
